{"body": "<html lang=\"ja\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no\">\n<style>\n    html{\n        text-size-adjust:100%;\n        -webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;\n    }\n    body{\n        line-height: 1.6;\n        font-size: 12px;\n        color: #fff;\n        padding: 10px;\n        max-width: 1400px;\n        margin: 0 auto;\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n        overflow-wrap: break-word;\n        word-wrap: break-word;\n        text-size-adjust:100%;\n        -webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;\n    }\n    /*ipad だけフォントサイズを上書き変更する*/\n    @media screen and (min-width: 768px) {\n        body {\n                font-size: 18px !important;\n        }\n    }\n    hr{\n        border: none;\n        border-top: 1px solid #a6b2be;\n        margin: 20px 0;\n        padding: 0;\n    }\n    img{\n        display: block;\n        max-width: 100%;\n        margin: 10px auto;\n    }\n    figcaption{\n        margin: 10px 0;\n    }\n    .news-title{\n        font-weight: bold;\n        color: #fff;\n        text-shadow: 1px 1px 0 rgba(11, 11, 87, .4), -1px 1px 0 rgba(11, 11, 87, .4), -1px -1px 0 rgba(11, 11, 87, .4), 1px -1px 0 rgba(11, 11, 87, .4);\n        background: linear-gradient(270deg, rgba(198, 255, 234, 0) 0%, rgba(114, 181, 255, 0.4) 100%);\n        padding: 4px 8px;\n        margin: 5px 0 10px 0;\n    }\n    .news-subtitle{\n        display: flex;\n        gap: 0 4px;\n        align-items: center;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        color: #6ed1ee;\n        margin: 5px 0 10px 0;\n    }\n    .news-subtitle img{\n        max-width: auto;\n        width: 14px;\n        margin: 0;\n        padding: 0;\n    }\n    /* 标题1 = 客户端 .news-title：蓝色渐变标题条（区块大标题，如「✦ 開催期間」） */\n    h1, .news-title{\n        font-size: 1.1em;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        color: #fff;\n        text-shadow: 1px 1px 0 rgba(11, 11, 87, .4), -1px 1px 0 rgba(11, 11, 87, .4), -1px -1px 0 rgba(11, 11, 87, .4), 1px -1px 0 rgba(11, 11, 87, .4);\n        background: linear-gradient(270deg, rgba(198, 255, 234, 0) 0%, rgba(114, 181, 255, 0.4) 100%);\n        padding: 4px 8px;\n        margin: 5px 0 10px 0;\n    }\n    /* 标题2 = 客户端 .news-subtitle：青色小标题 */\n    h2{\n        display: flex;\n        gap: 0 4px;\n        align-items: center;\n        font-size: 1em;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        color: #6ed1ee;\n        margin: 5px 0 10px 0;\n    }\n    p{\n        margin: 10px 0;\n    }\n\n   /* 上下スクロール（y軸）のみ許可 */\n   body {\n      touch-action: pan-y;\n   }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<p style=\"margin: 4px 0px; font-family: 等线; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2em;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">BanG Dreamer 여러분, 안녕하세요.</span></strong></p><p style=\"margin: 4px 0px; font-family: 等线; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2em;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">Ver.1.1.0 업데이트 이후, 게임 오픈 초기 일부 플레이어가 「GEKISO ARENA」 플레이 중 접속 오류를 겪은 바 있습니다.</span></strong></p><p style=\"margin: 4px 0px; font-family: 等线; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2em;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">해당 문제로 불편을 끼쳐 드린 점 진심으로 사과드리며, 모든 플레이어 여러분께 아래 보상을 지급할 예정입니다.</span></strong></p><p style=\"margin: 4px 0px; font-family: 等线; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2em;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><br/></span></strong></p><h1 style=\"margin: 4px 0px; font-family: 等线; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2em;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">✦ 보상 내용</span></strong></h1><p style=\"margin: 4px 0px; font-family: 等线; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2em;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">・스타 ×200</span></strong></p><p style=\"margin: 4px 0px; font-family: 等线; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2em;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><br/></span></strong></p><p style=\"margin: 4px 0px; font-family: 等线; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2em;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">【수령 기간】</span></strong></p><p style=\"margin: 4px 0px; font-family: 等线; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2em;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">2026/10/28 20:00 ~ 2026/11/03 23:59 (UTC+9)</span></strong></p><p style=\"margin: 4px 0px; font-family: 等线; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2em;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">※보상은 게임 내 「선물함」에서 수령해 주세요.</span></strong></p><p style=\"margin: 4px 0px; font-family: 等线; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2em;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">※현재도 접속 오류가 발생하는 경우, 게임 내 「메뉴」&gt;「유저 센터」&gt;「고객센터」를 통해 문의해 주세요.</span></strong></p><p style=\"margin: 4px 0px; font-family: 等线; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2em;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><br/></span></strong></p><p style=\"margin: 4px 0px; font-family: 等线; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2em;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">BanG Dreamer 여러분의 이해와 성원에 감사드립니다.</span></strong></p><p style=\"margin: 4px 0px; font-family: 等线; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2em;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">앞으로도 「뱅드림! 아워 노트」에 많은 관심과 성원 부탁드립니다!</span></strong></p><p><br/></p>\n</body>\n</html>", "category": "BUG", "endAt": "1793717940", "id": "100054", "lastUpdatedAt": "1793184367", "startAt": "1793185200", "title": "Ver.1.1.0 「GEKISO ARENA」 접속 오류 보상 안내"}